<title>CYPRUS: Average yield 6.12 percent on Cyprus t-bills.</title>
<headline>Average yield 6.12 percent on Cyprus t-bills.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus central bank said the average yield at a reverse repo auction of 14-day treasury bills was 6.12 percent, down 0.05 points from the average yield of 6.17 percent two weeks ago.</p>
<p>The central bank accepted tenders worth 10 million pounds with yields ranging from 6.15 to 6.10 percent, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It received offers totalling 11.5 million pounds.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
